        "impression_count": 0,
        "like_count": 86,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 6,
        "retweet_count": 4
      },
      "text": "The white shoes trend was definitely a plot by shoe companies to sell more shoes.\n\nAnd yes, I just got my white shoes dirty.\nAnd yes, I plan to buy an identical copy.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1527425449592340482"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2022-05-18T15:07:15.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1526942496994910209"
      ],
      "id": "1526942496994910209",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 13,
        "impression_count": 0,
        "like_count": 166,
        "quote_count": 2,
        "reply_count": 6,
        "retweet_count": 30
      },
      "text": "The only thing in business (and life in general) I know to be truly anti-fragile (i.e. gains from disorder) is authenticity.\n\n@elonmusk is the master class in this.\n\nFounders—remember this in present times and markets.\n\nBe authentic. Focus.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1526942496994910209"
    },
