        ],
        "text": "This thinking explains a lot about traditional aerospace over the past few decades. \n\nIn the '60s, we had a high urgency environment, and got Americans to the moon (from scratch) in ~8 years. \n\nAnd today... https://t.co/FEncympOXI"
