        ],
        "text": "Love this @alexandr_wang - “A dearth of optimism will slowly kill any product, team, or mission…Our optimism and resolve have immense influence in what we accomplish, both at a micro task-by-task level, and when summed up, what we can do over a lifetime.” Lets go!! https://t.co/df8MQWf2PA"
